  "solution": "From p = (1/3) * rho * <c^2>:\n<c^2> = 3p / rho = (3 * 1.05 x 10^5 Pa) / (1.25 kg m^-3) = 315000 / 1.25 = 2.52 x 10^5 m^2 s^-2.",
